---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/blog-placeholder-about.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Northstar Notes"
	description="A brief introduction to the ideas behind this blog."
	pubDate={new Date('August 08 2021')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		Northstar Notes is a simple publishing space for ideas that deserve to live longer than a chat
		snapshot. I use it to capture thoughtful observations about product work, software delivery,
		and the habits that help teams learn and improve over time.
	</p>

	<p>
		The goal is not to publish perfection, but to document useful lessons while they are still fresh.
		That means writing about process, decision-making, trade-offs, and the moments when a small change
		creates a noticeably better experience for people.
	</p>

	<p>
		This blog is a blend of personal notes and practical references: some pieces are reflections on
		what worked, some are experiments in how to build better systems, and others are reminders that
		good design often comes from patience, iteration, and clear communication.
	</p>

	<p>
		If you are a builder, a designer, or someone who enjoys learning from how others work, you will
		likely find something here worth revisiting. The writing is intentionally grounded in real work,
		clear thinking, and the messy reality of making useful things in public.
	</p>
</Layout>
